      "content": "I hear you on the trend analysis, but we're on a really tight schedule here. Management is pushing hard to keep this airframe in the rotation because the route tonight is a high-priority revenue leg. Honestly, if we pull it for a borescope now, we're looking at a massive delay and a huge hit to the flight schedule. \n\nDo you think these fluctuations are actually significant enough to risk a grounded maintenance event, or is it possible this is just some sensor noise/operational variance that's going to smooth out?",
